{% slide
   title="The Golden Rule: Safe Internet!"
   align="left"
   hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
**Attention! This is very important.**

Before sending your message to the AI, check this list.

- NEVER write your private details in the AI:
- Do not write your full name.
- Do not write your home address.
- Do not write your phone number.
- Do not write your exact location in real time.
{% /column %}

{% column %}
![slide_3_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-4-2/slide_3_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide
   title="The Golden Rule: Safe Internet!"
   align="left"
   hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
{% imageContainer
   title="Warning sign"
   width=200
   height=200
   crop={discriminant: false} %}
![slide_4_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-4-2/slide_4_Freeform_7.png)
{% /imageContainer %}
{% /column %}

{% column %}
**DANGEROUS** message example (Do not do this!):

- "Hi, I am John Perez. I live at 5 Main Street. Give me a plan near my house."
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

---

{% columns %}
{% column %}
{% imageContainer
   title="Person gesturing thumbs up"
   width=200
   height=200
   crop={discriminant: false} %}
![slide_4_Freeform_8.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-4-2/slide_4_Freeform_8.png)
{% /imageContainer %}
{% /column %}

{% column %}
**SAFE** message example (Do it like this!):

- "Give me a cheap plan in the city center."
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide
   title="Scenario 1 - The Bowling Club"
   align="left"
   hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
**Your situation:**

- You want to play bowling with your friends.
- You want to go this Saturday afternoon.
- You do not want to spend much money.
- You need the bowling alley to have a wheelchair ramp.
{% /column %}

{% column %}
![slide_5_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-4-2/slide_5_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

**Your challenge:**

- Write a safe message combining the 5 ingredients.

{% textInput
   contextForAI="Check if the user wrote a safe prompt for a bowling plan including time, place, budget, and wheelchair accessibility without sharing private information." /%}
{% /slide %}

{% slide
   title="Scenario 2 - The Basketball Match"
   align="left"
   hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
**Your situation:**

- You want to watch a basketball match live.
- You want a sports hall in your local area.
- You want a ticket that is free or very cheap.
- You want to go next Sunday morning.
- The place must have an elevator to reach the stands.
{% /column %}

{% column %}
![slide_6_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-4-2/slide_6_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

**Your challenge:**

- Write your safe message for the AI without sharing your data.

{% textInput
   contextForAI="Check if the user asks for a basketball match with local area, cheap/free ticket, Sunday morning, elevator accessibility, without sharing private data." /%}
{% /slide %}

{% slide
   title="Scenario 3 - The Painting Workshop"
   align="left"
   hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
**Your situation:**

- You want to learn to paint beautiful pictures.
- You want to find a painting class for beginners.
- You want the class to be in your neighborhood to walk there.
- You want it to be a free class.
- You want to do the class this Friday afternoon.
{% /column %}

{% column %}
![slide_7_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-4-2/slide_7_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

**Your challenge:**

- Write your message using the 5 ingredients in a safe way.

{% textInput
   contextForAI="Check if the user asks for a beginner painting class in neighborhood, free, Friday afternoon, safely using the ingredients." /%}
{% /slide %}

{% slide
   title="Scenario 4 - Dinosaur Exhibition"
   align="left"
   hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
**Your situation:**

- You love dinosaurs and history.
- You want to visit a fossil exhibition or a museum.
- You want a museum in your city.
- You have little money for the entrance ticket.
- You want to go this Saturday morning.
- The museum must not have stairs at the entrance.
{% /column %}

{% column %}
![slide_8_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-4-2/slide_8_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

**Your challenge:**

- Create a great message for the AI. Do not forget the money ingredient!

{% textInput
   contextForAI="Check if the user asks for a dinosaur museum in city, cheap ticket, Saturday morning, no stairs, without personal details." /%}
{% /slide %}

{% slide
   title="Scenario 5 - Board Games Club"
   align="left"
   hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
**Your situation:**

- You want to play Ludo, cards, or chess.
- You want to find a club to meet new people.
- You want the club to be near your favorite square.
- The activity must be completely free.
- You want to go next Thursday afternoon.
- The place must be very quiet with no loud noises.
{% /column %}

{% column %}
![slide_9_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-4-2/slide_9_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

**Your challenge:**

- Write a safe message.

{% textInput
   contextForAI="Check if the user asks for a board games club near favorite square, free, Thursday afternoon, quiet environment, without sharing personal data." /%}
{% /slide %}

{% slide
   title="Scenario 6 - Caring for Animals"
   align="left"
   hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
**Your situation:**

- You like dogs and cats very much.
- You want to help as a volunteer at an animal shelter.
- You want the shelter to be close to your town.
- You do not want to pay anything to help.
- You want to go and help on Sunday mornings.
- The access must have flat and easy paths to walk on.
{% /column %}

{% column %}
![slide_10_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-4-2/slide_10_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

**Your challenge:**

- Write a safe message.

{% textInput
   contextForAI="Check if the user asks for volunteer work at an animal shelter close to town, free, Sunday morning, flat access, without private details." /%}
{% /slide %}

{% slide
   title="Scenario 7 - I do not know what to do today!"
   align="left"
   hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
**Your situation:**

- You are very bored at home.
- You do not have any ideas for plans in your mind.
- You want the AI to give you 3 fun plan ideas.
- You want the plans to be in your city.
- You want very cheap activities.
- You want to go out this Saturday afternoon.
{% /column %}

{% column %}
![slide_11_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-4-2/slide_11_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

**Your challenge:**

- How do you ask for choices based on your taste without giving personal data?

{% textInput
   contextForAI="Check if the user asks for 3 cheap plan ideas in their city for Saturday afternoon without sharing personal data." /%}
{% /slide %}

{% slide
   title="Scenario 8 - The Great Free Challenge!"
   align="left"
   hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
**Your situation:**

- Now you have total control.
- Think of a real plan you truly want to do.
- Choose the activity you love the most in the world.
- Choose the day, the place, and your budget.
- There are no written clues or helps on the screen.
{% /column %}

{% column %}
![slide_12_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-4-2/slide_12_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

**Your challenge:**

- Write your message (prompt) to the AI completely on your own.

{% textInput
   contextForAI="Evaluate if the user wrote a complete prompt with activity, day, place, and budget without sharing private information." /%}
{% /slide %}
{% /slideshow %}
